msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "Gluais"

msgid "concrete model"
msgstr "múnla coincréite"

msgid ""
"A non-abstract (:attr:`abstract=False <django.db.models.Options.abstract>`) "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Múnla neamhtheibí (:attr:`abstract=Bréagach "
"<django.db.models.Options.abstract>`)."

msgid "field"
msgstr "réimse"

msgid ""
"An attribute on a :term:`model`; a given field usually maps directly to a "
"single database column."
msgstr ""
"Tréith ar :téarma:`múnla`; de ghnáth mapálann réimse ar leith go díreach "
"chuig colún bunachar sonraí amháin."

msgid "See :doc:`/topics/db/models`."
msgstr "Féach: doc:`/topics/db/models`."

msgid "generic view"
msgstr "radharc cineálach"

msgid ""
"A higher-order :term:`view` function that provides an abstract/generic "
"implementation of a common idiom or pattern found in view development."
msgstr ""
"Feidhm ardoird :téarma:`amharc` a sholáthraíonn cur i bhfeidhm teibí/"
"cineálta ar idiom nó ar phatrún coiteann a fhaightear i bhforbairt radhairc."

msgid "See :doc:`/topics/class-based-views/index`."
msgstr "Féach :doc:`/topics/class-based-views/ index`."

msgid "model"
msgstr "múnla"

msgid "Models store your application's data."
msgstr "Stórálann samhlacha sonraí d’fheidhmchláir."

msgid "MTV"
msgstr "MTV"

msgid ""
"\"Model-template-view\"; a software pattern, similar in style to MVC, but a "
"better description of the way Django does things."
msgstr ""
"\"Samhail-teimpléad-amharc\"; patrún bogearraí, cosúil le stíl MVC, ach cur "
"síos níos fearr ar an mbealach a dhéanann Django rudaí."

msgid "See :ref:`the FAQ entry <faq-mtv>`."
msgstr "Féach :tag:`an iontráil FAQ <faq-mtv>`."

msgid "MVC"
msgstr "MVC"

msgid ""
"`Model-view-controller`__; a software pattern. Django :ref:`follows MVC to "
"some extent <faq-mtv>`."
msgstr ""
"`Samhail-amharc-rialtóir`__; patrún bogearraí. Django :tag:`leanann MVC go "
"pointe <faq-mtv>`."

msgid "project"
msgstr "tionscadal"

msgid ""
"A Python package -- i.e. a directory of code -- that contains all the "
"settings for an instance of Django. This would include database "
"configuration, Django-specific options and application-specific settings."
msgstr ""
"Pacáiste Python -- i.e. eolaire cód -- ina bhfuil na socruithe go léir le "
"haghaidh sampla de Django. Áireofaí leis seo cumraíocht bunachar sonraí, "
"roghanna a bhaineann go sonrach le Django agus socruithe a bhaineann go "
"sonrach le feidhmchlár."

msgid "property"
msgstr "maoin"

msgid ""
"Also known as \"managed attributes\", and a feature of Python since version "
"2.2. This is a neat way to implement attributes whose usage resembles "
"attribute access, but whose implementation uses method calls."
msgstr ""
"Ar a dtugtar freisin \"tréithe bainistithe\", agus gné de Python ó leagan "
"2.2. Is bealach néata é seo chun tréithe a chur i bhfeidhm a bhfuil a n-"
"úsáid cosúil le rochtain aitreabúide, ach a úsáideann glaonna modha lena "
"gcur chun feidhme."

msgid "See :class:`property`."
msgstr "Féach:aicme:`property`."

msgid "queryset"
msgstr "sraith ceiste"

msgid ""
"An object representing some set of rows to be fetched from the database."
msgstr ""
"Rud a sheasann do shraith áirithe sraitheanna le fáil ón mbunachar sonraí."

msgid "See :doc:`/topics/db/queries`."
msgstr "Féach :doc:`/topics/db/queries`."

msgid "slug"
msgstr "sluga"

msgid ""
"A short label for something, containing only letters, numbers, underscores "
"or hyphens. They're generally used in URLs. For example, in a typical blog "
"entry URL:"
msgstr ""
"Lipéad gairid do rud éigin, nach bhfuil ann ach litreacha, uimhreacha, "
"béimeanna nó fleiscíní. Úsáidtear iad go ginearálta i URLanna. Mar shampla, "
"i URL iontrála blag tipiciúil:"

msgid "the last bit (``spring``) is the slug."
msgstr "is é an giota deireanach (``spring``) an sluga."

msgid "template"
msgstr "teimpléad"

msgid ""
"A chunk of text that acts as formatting for representing data. A template "
"helps to abstract the presentation of data from the data itself."
msgstr ""
"Sliotán téacs a fheidhmíonn mar fhormáidiú chun sonraí a léiriú. Cuidíonn "
"teimpléad le cur i láthair sonraí a asbhaint ó na sonraí féin."

msgid "See :doc:`/topics/templates`."
msgstr "Féach :doc:`/topics/templates`."

msgid "view"
msgstr "amharc"

msgid "A function responsible for rendering a page."
msgstr "Feidhm atá freagrach as leathanach a rindreáil."
